{
  "$comment": "Role -> slot keys of the WordPress content contracts (content-map.json), read from the release named in `checked`. Each role lists groups: a group is written whole or not at all. Fields: text/title/label/name/description are text slots, href a url slot, price an optional text slot (empty when nothing was collected); `$item` names the block holding a list group, kept when the list has no value for it: a dish item under a neutral name, its description and badge empty, its price empty. `facts`: blocks outside the slots showing a demo fact, written from the collected facts or hidden. `placeholders`: sections of the template's own facts whose text slots take the placeholder unless the `unless` role was written. `sections`: section name -> what the hand-off asks of it. A key the contract gives to two blocks names the first, the one the door writes.",
